urface":"三老","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、官稱、對話或未名者待核；普通動詞、詐稱與矯命不當真實人物身份。"},{"id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe:m003-0289","start":289,"end":291,"surface":"豪傑","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、官稱、對話或未名者待核；普通動詞、詐稱與矯命不當真實人物身份。"},{"id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe:m003-0298","start":298,"end":300,"surface":"三老","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、官稱、對話或未名者待核；普通動詞、詐稱與矯命不當真實人物身份。"},{"id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe:m003-0301","start":301,"end":303,"surface":"豪傑","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、官稱、對話或未名者待核；普通動詞、詐稱與矯命不當真實人物身份。"},{"id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe:m003-0337","start":337,"end":339,"surface":"陳涉","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002979","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe","book_id":"b-shiji-048","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-048-chenshe"},{"id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe:p004","text":"當此時，諸郡縣苦秦吏者，皆刑其長吏，殺之以應陳涉。乃以吳叔為假王，監諸將以西擊滎陽。令陳人武臣、張耳、陳餘徇趙地，令汝陰人鄧宗徇九江郡。當此時，楚兵數千人為聚者，不可勝數。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe:m004-0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"陳涉","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002979","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe:m004-0027","start":27,"end":29,"surface":"吳叔","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002980","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe:m004-0045","start":45,"end":47,"surface":"武臣","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002984","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe:m004-0048","start":48,"end":50,"surface":"張耳","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002985","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe:m004-0051","start":51,"end":53,"surface":"陳餘","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002986","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe:m004-0061","start":61,"end":63,"surface":"鄧宗","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002987","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe","book_id":"b-shiji-048","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-048-chenshe"},{"id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe:p005","text":"葛嬰至東城，立襄彊為楚王。嬰後聞陳王已立，因殺襄彊，還報。至陳，陳王誅殺葛嬰。陳王令魏人周市北徇魏地。吳廣圍滎陽。李由為三川守，守滎陽，吳叔弗能下。陳王徵國之豪傑與計，以上蔡人房君蔡賜為上柱國。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe:m005-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"葛嬰","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002983","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe:m005-0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"襄彊","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002988","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe:m005-0013","start":13,"end":14,"surface":"嬰","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002983","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe:m005-0016","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"陳王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002979","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe:m005-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"襄彊","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002988","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe:m005-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"陳王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002979","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe:m005-0036","start":36,"end":38,"surface":"葛嬰","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002983","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe:m005-0039","start":39,"end":41,"surface":"陳王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002979","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe:m005-0044","start":44,"end":46,"surface":"周市","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002989","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe:m005-0051","start":51,"end":53,"surface":"吳廣","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002980","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe:m005-0057","start":57,"end":59,"surface":"李由","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002990","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe:m005-0068","start":68,"end":70,"surface":"吳叔","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002980","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe:m005-0074","start":74,"end":76,"surface":"陳王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002979","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe:m005-0088","start":88,"end":92,"surface":"房君蔡賜","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002964","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe:m005-0094","start":94,"end":96,"surface":"柱國","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002964","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe","book_id":"b-shiji-048","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-048-chenshe"},{"id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe:p010","text":"將軍田臧等相與謀曰：「周章軍已破矣，秦兵旦暮至，我圍滎陽城弗能下，秦軍至，必大敗。不如少遺兵，足以守熒一作「滎」陽，悉精兵迎秦軍。今假王驕，不知兵權，不可與計，非誅之，事恐敗。」因相與矯王令以誅吳叔，獻其首於陳王。陳王使使賜田臧楚令尹印，使為上將。田臧乃使諸將李歸等守滎陽城，自以精兵西迎秦軍於敖倉。與戰，田臧死，軍破。章邯進兵擊李歸等滎陽下，破之，李歸等死。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe:m010-0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"田臧","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002997","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe:m010-0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"周章","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002991","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe:m010-0097","start":97,"end":99,"surface":"吳叔","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002980","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe:m010-0104","start":104,"end":106,"surface":"陳王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002979","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe:m010-0107","start":107,"end":109,"surface":"陳王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002979","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe:m010-0112","start":112,"end":114,"surface":"田臧","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002997","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe:m01